#: ../../.opencode/agents/functional-qa-engineer.md:20
msgid ""
"Before validating behavior, run `hero_drift` on the spec slug to check "
"for spec-vs-code divergence. Include any drift warnings in your "
"validation report — unaddressed criteria and boundary violations are "
"strong signals of gaps."
msgstr ""

